# Nodes whose traffic leaves through the VM's real uplink (uplink=real), to
# reach the real relay and nodes on the internet. Every packet then crosses two
# more NATs after the emulated one: the VM's own masquerade (lab.sh adds it) and
# the i3D host's masquerade (213.163.75.157). See README.
real1    easy             uplink=real
real2    symmetric        uplink=real
# A lab-internal node too, so the local relay/directory and selftest still work.
lab1     easy
